OL,3,GNEWSALiquid Spice 'worth more than #1m'
OL,4,Afound in cellar
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiquid Spice with an estimated street
OL,7,Fvalue of #1m has been found by police
OL,8,Finvestigating the use of the illegal
OL,9,Fdrug in Bradford.
OL,11,FOfficers discovered 35 litres of the
OL,12,Fsynthetic cannabinoid in the basement
OL,13,Fof an address in Haworth, West
OL,14,FYorkshire, on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThey also seized around #10,000 in cash
OL,17,Ffrom an address in central Bradford,
OL,18,Fwith mobile phones seized from both
OL,19,Fproperties.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
