OL,3,GNEWSALiquid Spice 'worth more than #1m'
OL,4,Afound in cellar
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaaris Hussain, 35, of Dean Street,
OL,7,FHaworth, and Awais Mustapha, 28, of
OL,8,FWoodlands Street, Bradford, have been
OL,9,Fcharged with offences including being
OL,10,Fconcerned in the supply of a Class B
OL,11,Fdrug.
